  "description": "Machine-readable conformance manifest for the .khata format. Declares the corpus cases (inputs, pinned by sha256), the three conformance tiers, and the language-neutral engine-adapter query contract that Tiers C and R run through. A conforming engine ships one adapter (see ../adapters/README.md) and this manifest drives the harness against it.",
  "hashContract": {
    "spec": "../spec/canonical-json.md",
